{"task_id": "HumanEval/55", "solution": "def fib(n: int):\n    \"\"\"Return n-th Fibonacci number.\n    Handles invalid input and computes iteratively for efficiency.\n    >>> fib(10)\n    55\n    >>> fib(1)\n    1\n    >>> fib(8)\n    21\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(n, int) or n < 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Invalid input: n must be a non-negative integer.\")\n\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n    if n == 1:\n        return 1\n\n    a, b = 0, 1\n    for _ in range(2, n + 1):\n        a, b = b, a + b\n    return b"}
